<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-02T07:51:33.769Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:51:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to target civilians and security forces in Plateau, killing a soldier and stealing weapons at checkpoints and abducting students and worshippers, while ISWAP leaders and a shura council member were killed by troops in Borno. The attacks on worshippers in Kaduna resulted in seventeen deaths in captivity and four remain held. A drone strike by ISWAP in Borno killed two soldiers and injured thirteen. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNdXVib1JfRjZjSzVhZHdDQU9WNGItdk5kd2s3REFyN21jZ0NaNDBBcWE1NFJtQ3hzTXAwQ21KRk5xc1k5R3VYdmZ1U2pGMnJQRmE5a0N5Njl4YUpEazM5c0lMTUo3UHlKLVB4UDNvSDd0WHR5RFltMEs3R2MtUVdKVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPcnRXdk9CaTNwcm9yaG92eVdNMGtzUjBRaDM2c0FuS1FheFVfbVNZdVRJZUdCQ0d3MjlCTTlVS1JZRDVTdWMxTTRVVGxyRWFYSDI4dk81SjRGX1hZSTNJRVNUbGdqNkNkMDJXb3Q1ZDNXcUltbkJOd1hsM0ItbE9PMnpJY29OcVNXU1cydW5vcVV0V0N2U2V3MC1n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxON1pLY3NlcmlhSXBuNTlxMS1aWjI4U3gtTWxWNzVHSWlZb3ZUM1lSTmlZTnctVzhtZHVmZXlZYWtJX2VTNjk3Ny1tbEZoTm9fNEtMNkc3RlBfbWNndTNkZ21DWF8wcE9CdGM2SldjblE3QnBOLWxhVldrRHV6dzM0VW52NmR0MFZLenlNeWRXenI1bVd2bmstVC1ZMlktRG9qcHQ2ckNYWXZxbnM4eERJWFFxVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPMU9jS3BNOWxMTm1qd3o5U0J0Q3dyTzc1SFI3UFh2bnJCUjZCemJZSUVlbTUtU1A5bVNNMm5EVjVoZHA1NGFvSGtsX29IZlpxZTZwWS1RdUV0UjRkdmM1SFRKVGh6Q3VuM0JRamM4dlB6cTJ2SkxmblI2YmF3Unp2alZud0tzMWI1dFJPN0VQeUR5bTJyVVVmQ0JYNGk5QzlyTmNxdEJKQmhqV1U4ck1NSHhDT1drdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMil